# The question-bank rebuild pipeline's corpus copies and runtime state.
# `qbr/data/raw` is a 6.3M copy of official PDFs that already live under 國考題資料夾/ - the copy
# exists so the suite can run without the 267M corpus, and it is derived, not authored. `qbr/runs`
# and `qbr/tmp` are per-run output. The golden file under qbr/tests/golden/ is NOT ignored: it is
# the one artifact that must travel with the code, because it is what proves the code still reads
# a paper the same way.
qbr/data/
qbr/runs/
qbr/tmp/
qbr/.venv/
